**Spoken-count pricing (words data, `asr-segments.json` in the digest dir — the technique is timed to the count):**
- "Texas" first named 85.05 s; TX population narration runs 85.63–87.03 ("which has a huge population") — census: TX count-up completes inside this span ✓.
- "Vermont" named 87.63 s; VT sentence ends 89.19 s — census: VT column + count-up inside this span ✓.
